  "meta": {
    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "A new mob. It is a creature with a 0.9 by 1.6 block hitbox, 40 health (20 hearts) and a walking speed of 0.28. Its goals run in list order: melee_attack with retaliate and no targets means it only fights back when hurt, hitting for 4 damage (msm:attack) and firing msm_examples:stone_sentinel_attack; otherwise it wanders and looks about. It spawns naturally in every mountain biome (#minecraft:is_mountain) in groups of one or two, has a spawn egg with its own texture, drops the loot table msm_examples:entities/stone_sentinel, and its death event spawns sparks and runs a function. msm:animated_model names the model, animation set and texture with renderer auto (GeckoLib where the target has it, the runtime's own renderer elsewhere); scale 0.8 shrinks the two-block biped model to the hitbox. Export the Fabric mod jar to try it in game.",
    "tags": [
      "example",
      "entities"
    ]
  }
